<title>USA: Bell to market Metrocall services.</title>
<headline>Bell to market Metrocall services.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metrocall Inc said Tuesday that it had established an alliance with Bell Atlantic Corp to offer paging and messaging services.</p>
<p>Metrocall said Bell Atlantic will offer the company's local, regional and nationwide paging services to its customers using direct mail and outbound telesales efforts.</p>
<p>The company added that Bell Atlantic will provide Metrocall paging services to a potential market of 15 million consumer and business customers.</p>
</text>
